# Three influenced mods: Dominance keeps upgrading until crit is elevated or too few mods remain.
buy "Astral Plate" ilvl 86 rare influence hunter
    with "Hunter: attack crit" tier 2
    with "Hunter: max life %" tier 1
    with "Hunter: Offerings" tier 1
    for 50 chaos
until has "Hunter: attack crit" elevated or influenced_count < 2 {
    dominance
}
goal has "Hunter: attack crit" elevated
